        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3886310/extras/19cf13600a6641fe96d7fda4de0da2a3.avif?t=1761095647\" width=1280 height=224 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>KOALAS DELIV &amp; GUY</strong> is a physics-based, comedy action game!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are a flying<strong> KOALA</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And you’ve got the power to unleash a mighty shockwave — the <strong>KOALAS WAVE!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your buddy is <strong>NICEGUY</strong>, a super-flexible, floppy human.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >He's a really good dude.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your one and only mission:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use KOALAS WAVE to launch, float, and guide Nice Guy all the way to the goal!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But don’t get cocky —</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If Nice Guy goes off-course even once, it’s game over.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No worries, though — you can retry as many times as you like!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Crashes, slips, falls... it won’t be easy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But Koala and Nice Guy are an unbreakable team.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trust in your bond and aim for the goal — together!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A flying KOALA...? For real?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >・You control a koala that can fly freely through the sky</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >・You can phase through any object</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >・You can unleash two kinds of KOALAS WAVE — one light, one strong</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >So who is this “<strong>NICEGUY</strong>”?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >・He’s super tough — nothing makes him mad, no matter how hard he crashes</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >・Through intense training, he became a floppy man</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >・He trusts the koala with all his heart</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Controls</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Direction Buttons (Left Stick):</strong> Move the Koala</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A (B) Button or A (S) Key:</strong> Shockwave</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>F Key or Y Button:</strong> Open Menu</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>◆ Game Streaming Guidelines ◆</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We warmly welcome gameplay videos and live streams of this game!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Monetization is also allowed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If possible, please include the Steam store page URL in your video description or stream details!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Note</strong><br>This game was created with <strong>Action Game Maker MV</strong>, so <strong>Steam achievements are not supported.</strong></p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3886310/extras/19cf13600a6641fe96d7fda4de0da2a3.avif?t=1761095647\" width=1280 height=224 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>KOALAS DELIV &amp; GUY</strong> is a physics-based, comedy action game!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are a flying<strong> KOALA</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And you’ve got the power to unleash a mighty shockwave — the <strong>KOALAS WAVE!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your buddy is <strong>NICEGUY</strong>, a super-flexible, floppy human.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >He's a really good dude.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your one and only mission:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use KOALAS WAVE to launch, float, and guide Nice Guy all the way to the goal!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But don’t get cocky —</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If Nice Guy goes off-course even once, it’s game over.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No worries, though — you can retry as many times as you like!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Crashes, slips, falls... it won’t be easy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But Koala and Nice Guy are an unbreakable team.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trust in your bond and aim for the goal — together!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A flying KOALA...? For real?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >・You control a koala that can fly freely through the sky</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >・You can phase through any object</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >・You can unleash two kinds of KOALAS WAVE — one light, one strong</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >So who is this “<strong>NICEGUY</strong>”?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >・He’s super tough — nothing makes him mad, no matter how hard he crashes</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >・Through intense training, he became a floppy man</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >・He trusts the koala with all his heart</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Controls</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Direction Buttons (Left Stick):</strong> Move the Koala</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A (B) Button or A (S) Key:</strong> Shockwave</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>F Key or Y Button:</strong> Open Menu</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>◆ Game Streaming Guidelines ◆</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We warmly welcome gameplay videos and live streams of this game!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Monetization is also allowed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If possible, please include the Steam store page URL in your video description or stream details!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Note</strong><br>This game was created with <strong>Action Game Maker MV</strong>, so <strong>Steam achievements are not supported.</strong></p>",
        "short_description": "Use the shockwaves from a flying KOALA to carry your buddy, NICEGUY, to the goal! Go off course and it’s game over! But don’t worry—you can try as many times as you want! Now, experience the ultimate physics-based, comical action game!",
